"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:p003","text":"昭王七年，樗里子死，而使涇陽君質於齊。趙人樓緩來相秦，趙不利，乃使仇液之秦，請以魏冉為秦相。仇液將行，其客宋公謂液曰：「秦不聽公，樓緩必怨公。公不若謂樓緩曰『請為公毋急秦』。秦王見趙請相魏冉之不急，且不聽公。公言而事不成，以德樓子；事成，魏冉故德公矣。」於是仇液從之。而秦果免樓緩而魏冉相秦。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"vny_0sw_kdz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"樗里子","kind":"person","person_id":"zev_jx4_vaz","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"涇陽君","kind":"person","person_id":"dq0_1ox_9ny","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"5he_z7b_nzv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"仇液","kind":"person","person_id":"9zv_c2c_v3b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"魏冉","kind":"person","person_id":"gbi_qsy_i7l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"仇液","kind":"person","person_id":"9zv_c2c_v3b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"宋公","kind":"person","person_id":"7ou_w2x_zxh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"液","kind":"person","person_id":"9zv_c2c_v3b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0063","start":63,"end":64,"surface":"公","kind":"person","person_id":"9zv_c2c_v3b","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"5he_z7b_nzv","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-072-rang:m003-0069","start":69,"end":70,"surface":"公","kind":"person","person_id":"9zv_c2c_v3b"